{
  "slug": "revolut-x",
  "name": "Revolut X",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Trade crypto, query account state, stream market data, run live indicator alerts, and operate grid bots on the Revolut X exchange. Placing orders, checking balances, watching RSI/EMA/MACD, backtesting grid strategies.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **7 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (7): `revx-account` (Revolut X account and order queries), `revx-auth` (Revolut X CLI setup and authentication), `revx-market` (Revolut X market data commands), `revx-monitor` (Revolut X live price and indicator monitoring), `revx-strategy` (Revolut X grid trading strategy), `revx-telegram` (Revolut X Telegram notification connector), `revx-trading` (Revolut X order placement, replacement and cancellation)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install revolut-x@claude-community` from `revolut-engineering/revolut-x-api`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "wrapper",
  "wrapper": "skill",
  "sourceType": "community",
